The test fixture under samples/nhanes-participant/ is the published package of the NHANES Participant model of the
FAIR Data Demo (https://github.com/SemanticDataCharter/FAIR_Data_Demo), fetched from SDCStudio's public catalog, a
Semantic Data Charter model of National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (CDC) variables; it is used as
evidence, unchanged.

The test fixture under samples/halvorsen-credit-note/ is the published package of the Credit Note model of the
business documents library and one Credit Note record generated by HalvorsenDemo
(https://github.com/SemanticDataCharter/HalvorsenDemo, Apache 2.0), whose companies and documents are fictitious; it
is used as evidence, unchanged.
